{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048340/extras/b7656558f98a1f5f905bc229f2ac1ace.webp?t=1764972797\" width=344 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starring the one and only &quot;Goofer the Gopher&quot;...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048340/extras/b7743e0e40f8494959e5066f2897d639.avif?t=1764972797\" width=160 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a variety of different retro-inspired mini games, as if it were a gaming night out in the 1980's/'90s!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048340/extras/54e92bbe473c3388d8d70a219888493b.poster.avif?t=1764972797\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048340/extras/54e92bbe473c3388d8d70a219888493b.webm?t=1764972797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048340/extras/54e92bbe473c3388d8d70a219888493b.mp4?t=1764972797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go from classic pinball, to puzzles, to platformers, to shoot-'em-ups, adventure games, a rhythm game (with a custom song editor!), PLUS point-and-click games, tabletop games, billiards, and even some gambling! Unlock each mini game one by one as you go along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048340/extras/32cae5ee932332c12a46d03bd29f02c1.poster.avif?t=1764972797\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048340/extras/32cae5ee932332c12a46d03bd29f02c1.webm?t=1764972797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048340/extras/32cae5ee932332c12a46d03bd29f02c1.mp4?t=1764972797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all of the mini games while getting to the absolute highest score that you can possibly reach! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's even an option to play with classic CRT display/VHS filters, to make the '80s/'90s arcade theme feel really authentic! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLUS, the mini games have all-time high score leaderboards!\u00a0You\u2019ll have to check back in every once in a while if you want to keep your top spot!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playthrough of this game is only a couple hours long, so it\u2019s rather mini \u2014 but it\u2019s extremely re-playable and jam-packed with tons of fun! It's an indie bonanza extravaganza!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the arcade!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048340/6e7bc094123cc96c96ec28bc3628a9e2d613bf27.jpg"},{"name":"Congrats, GAME OVER!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048340/acbf58b75c83a881b2fdfed2430481c5b68a9aed.jpg"},{"name":"Coin Catch \u2014 GOAL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048340/a9ca87fc53442bdb039a0686d3ed8e571e1ce400.jpg"},{"name":"Coin Catch \u2014 MASTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048340/0b4b69bdcdbed95d58fd47079ce32c9daaf7ec0c.jpg"},{"name":"Jumper \u2014 GOAL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048340/f65b1e319a7891cce80c7b05cfd5312be6341d39.jpg"},{"name":"Jumper \u2014 MASTER","path":