span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048340/extras/b7743e0e40f8494959e5066f2897d639.avif?t=1764972797\" width=160 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a variety of different retro-inspired mini games, as if it were a gaming night out in the 1980's/'90s!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048340/extras/54e92bbe473c3388d8d70a219888493b.poster.avif?t=1764972797\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048340/extras/54e92bbe473c3388d8d70a219888493b.webm?t=1764972797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048340/extras/54e92bbe473c3388d8d70a219888493b.mp4?t=1764972797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go from classic pinball, to puzzles, to platformers, to shoot-'em-ups, adventure games, a rhythm game (with a custom song editor!), PLUS point-and-click games, tabletop games, billiards, and even some gambling! Unlock each mini game one by one as you go along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048340/extras/32cae5ee932332c12a46d03bd29f02c1.poster.avif?t=1764972797\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048340/extras/32cae5ee932332c12a46d03bd29f02c1.webm?t=1764972797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048340/extras/32cae5ee932332c12a46d03bd29f02c1.mp4?t=1764972797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all of the mini games while getting to the absolute highest score that you can possibly reach! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's even an option to play with classic CRT display/VHS filters, to make the '80s/'90s arcade theme feel really authentic! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLUS, the mini games have all-time high score leaderboards!\u00a0You\u2019ll have to check back in every once in a while if you want to keep your top spot!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playthrough of this game is only a couple hours long, so it\u2019s rather mini \u2014 but it\u2019s extremely re-playable and jam-packed with tons of fun! It's an indie bonanza extravaganza!</p>","developers":["Svinta","Keri"],"dlc":[3477290],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048340/header.jpg?t=1764972797","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Mr. Goofer is not responsible for any injuries as a result of his mischief, under penalty of law.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 22.1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 150 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 150 MB</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 150 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 150</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3048340/811560/2b0901c9ef06c1b4941ac41aadd1cb771d436581/1750970821/dash_av1.mpd?t=1736714563","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3048340/811560/2b0901c9ef06c1b4941ac41aadd1cb771d436581/1750970821/dash_h264.mpd?t=1736714563","high